{"unit_id":"RayJitan__dsh-ima-ragplugin#feature-knowledge-base-tools","repo":"RayJitan/dsh-ima-ragplugin","commit":"8661767ea7e26b762236e539924669f0f97b97b6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ima-ragplugin 的功能「知识库列表与检索」：通过 ima_kb_list 查看账号可访问及当前会话已选的知识库，再用 ima_kb_search 查询选定知识库并返回原文片段；也可显式指定知识库和结果条数。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/host.js:1143-1234"]}
