{"unit_id":"RayJitan__dsh-ima-ragplugin#caveat-ima-service","repo":"RayJitan/dsh-ima-ragplugin","commit":"8661767ea7e26b762236e539924669f0f97b97b6","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ima-ragplugin 使用前须知：知识库列表、检索、问答与签到功能会连接 ima.qq.com，需配置有效的 IMA 登录凭据；桌面凭据同步入口读取本机 IMA 桌面客户端数据。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/ima-api.js:18","lib/checkin.js:47","lib/desktop-sync.js:219"]}
